  "description": "Aspiring film director Jeonghyeok talks to an eccentric guy named Yuda after seeing him photograph dead animals. Having been neglected all his life, Yuda is drawn to Jeonghyeok's warmth, and Jeonghyeok is also drawn to Yuda's quirks. Meanwhile, Jaehee, who has bonded with Yuda over past scars, grows jealous of the mysterious new friend Yuda mentions and tries to uncover his identity. Unaware of their mutual connection to Yuda, Jeonghyeok and Jaehee also meet and grow closer, which leads to the rise of unexpected feelings... What will happen to this odd trio tangled in a web of love and obsession?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
